{"ID":"20240205153652-w5ir60f","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"custom-sy-readonly":"true","id":"20240205153652-w5ir60f","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240205153652-w5ir60f\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240205172655-3jpg4k5\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240612165526-z1eppqt\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:4080\u0026#125;","title":"267半夏","type":"doc","updated":"20240822101212"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240205172655-3jpg4k5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240205172655-3jpg4k5","updated":"20240205172707"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【产地】\t主产甘肃、湖北、四川、安徽、江苏、河南，浙江等地。\n【性状】\t本品呈类球形，有的稍偏斜，表面白色或浅黄色，顶端有凹陷的茎痕，周围密布麻点状根痕；下面钝圆，较光滑。质坚实、断面洁白，富粉性。气微，味辛辣、麻舌而刺喉。\n【性味】\t辛、温，有毒。\n【功效】\t燥湿化痰，降逆止呕，消痞散结。用于湿痰寒痰，咳喘痰多，痰饮 眩悸，风痰眩晕，痰厥头痛.呕吐反胃.胸院痞闷，梅核气；外治痛肿痰核。\n【炙品】\t法半夏：本品呈类球形或破碎成不规则颗粒状。表面淡黄白色、黄色或棕黄色。质较松脆或硬脆，断面黄色或淡黄色，颗粒者质稍硬脆。气微，味淡略甘、微有麻舌感。辛，温，归脾、胃、肺经。燥湿化痰。用于痰多咳喘，痰饮眩悸，风痰眩晕、痰厥头痛。\n姜半夏：本品呈片状、不规则颗粉状或类球形。表面棕色至棕褐色。质 硬脆，断面淡黄棕色，常具角质样光泽。气微香，味淡、微有麻舌感，嚼之略粘牙。辛，温。归脾、胃、肺经。温中化痰，降逆止呕。用于痰饮呕吐，胃脘痞满。\n清半夏：本品椭圆形、类圆形或不规则的片。切面淡灰色至灰白色。可见灰白色点状或短线状维管束迹。有的残留栓皮处下方显淡紫红色斑纹。质脆，易折断，断面略呈角质样。气微，味微涩，微有麻舌感。辛，温。归脾、胃、肺经。燥湿化痰。用于湿痰咳嗽，胃肤痞满，痰涎凝聚。 咯吐不出。"}]},{"ID":"20240205172654-49vsei1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240205172654-49vsei1","updated":"20240205172654"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240205172654-4k36irt.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240205163723-gonenel","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240205163723-gonenel","updated":"20240822100527"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"半夏"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/半夏-20240205163723-zzyuq63.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240627172834-al6rvpl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240627172834-al6rvpl","updated":"20240822100818"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 510px;","style":"width: 500px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"半夏 (2)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/半夏 2-20240822100816-6oplppb.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 500px;\" parent-style=\"width: 510px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240221192522-i9w47dr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240221192522-i9w47dr","updated":"20240822100730"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 408px;","style":"width: 398px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"半夏5"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/半夏5-20240627172757-q08id8n.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 398px;\" parent-style=\"width: 408px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​​​​​​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 766px;","style":"width: 756px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240221192522-amg8ji1.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 756px;\" parent-style=\"width: 766px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240627173112-rskhlf7","